#Secondary Weapons
; Retail bomb-class torpedoes (every secondary flagged "Bomb") share one damage
; type so RTS Command Hull can cut their station damage. Ship damage is
; unchanged. Blast damage has its own type; setting only the impact type leaves
; the shockwave, which carries most of a torpedo's damage, uncapped.
; THIS LIST IS MACHINE-AUDITED against the retail "Bomb" set by
; core/tools/test_table_references.py.
